    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="65">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 65</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ac healde gehwa mid rihte his æwe þa hwile þe heo libbe; buton þæt gewurðe, þæt hi buta geceosan be biscopes geþeahte, þæt hi getwæman 7 þanon forð willan clænnesse healdan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But each is to keep rightly his legal wife as long as she lives; unless it comes about that they both choose to separate with the bishop's advice and wish henceforth to preserve chastity.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">But everyone is to keep his lawful wife as is right while she lives, unless it so happens with the bishop's guidance that they both decide to separate and remain chaste henceforth.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
